# Stack

- Backend: Node.js 24+, TypeScript, Fastify, Zod, PostgreSQL 16, Drizzle ORM, Better Auth.
- Documentação: `@fastify/swagger` + Scalar.
- Pacote do app: `gestao-projetos-api`.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
import { PrismaClient } from "@prisma/client";
await prisma.project.findMany();

// ✅ GOOD
import { eq } from "drizzle-orm";
import { db } from "../db";
import { projects } from "../db/schema";
await db.select().from(projects).where(eq(projects.ownerId, userId));
```

- Não instale Prisma, `@prisma/client` nem gere `schema.prisma`.
- Preserve Better Auth, `emailAndPassword.disableSignUp: true` e `user.role` com `input: false`.
- Validação HTTP com Zod no schema da rota Fastify, nunca só no frontend.
